  "summary": "Bangladeshi art is a form of visual arts that has been practiced throughout the land of what is now known as Bangladesh.",
  "description": "Bangladeshi art is a form of visual arts that has been practiced throughout the land of what is now known as Bangladesh. Bangladeshi art has a perennial history that originated more than two thousand years ago and is practiced even to this date. Among the various forms of Bangladeshi art, photography, architecture, sculpture, and painting are the most notable.",
